Usage: GrinPP [options]
--help	Display this help message
--floonet	Use floonet chain
--automated-testing	Use AUTOMATED_TESTING chain (test-only)
--headless	Run headless app with no console output
--no-wallet	Run only a node, not a wallet
--shared-node [host:port]	Uses the node at the given address and port (grinnode.live:80)
--config-path [path_to_config]	Uses the config file at the path provided
